## CoalesceBatchesExec with fetch
  case default:
    CoalesceBatchesExec: target_batch_size=8192, fetch=10
      MockSourceExec: partitioning=UnknownPartitioning(3), partition_rows=[200, 0, 400], statistics=Exact
